{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22289","headline":"除官去未间 · 白居易","name":"除官去未间","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"除官去未间，半月恣游讨。\n朝寻霞外寺，暮宿波上岛。\n新树少於松，平湖半连草。\n跻攀有次第，赏玩无昏早。\n有时骑马醉，兀兀冥天造。\n穷通与生死，其奈吾怀抱。\n江山信爲美，齿发行将老。\n在郡诚未厌，归乡去亦好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}